# The lists stay out: large, personal, quickly stale, and never read by the app
# at runtime. `key_list.txt` is what a filter gets built from, not what the page
# fetches, so keeping it out costs the deployment nothing.
#
# The filter itself is tracked, and has to be. It is the only one of these the
# page actually loads, and without it a deployment screens nothing, asks the
# chain about every address, and cannot roll at all for anyone who has not
# brought an Etherscan key.
key_list/
src/assets/
.venv-checker/
